                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Warm graphite, dark designed first. Surfaces carry a faint brown cast so Bitcoin orange sits in the same light rather than bolted on top. Orange is scarce — one accent per view, reserved for selection, the primary action, or a single meaningful highlight. Semantic colour never carries meaning alone: every positive, warning and danger role is paired with a word, marker or icon. Focus blue is a focus ring and nothing else.",
